{"name":"Tabriz Teal","hex":"#005553","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"teal","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various small freshwater ducks of the genus Anas that are brightly coloured and have short necks.","A dark, somewhat bluish-green colour; a dark cyan."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a bluish-green colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/teal"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tabriz","blocks":[{"text":"Tabriz is a city in the Central District of Tabriz County, in East Azerbaijan province of northwestern Iran. It serves as capital of the province, the county, and the district. It is the sixth-most-populous city in Iran."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Tabriz_Municipality_Sa%27at_Tower.jpg/330px-Tabriz_Municipality_Sa%27at_Tower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tabriz","wikidata":"Q80053"},{"title":"Teal","blocks":[{"text":"Teal is a dark cyan color. Its name comes from that of a bird, the Eurasian teal which has a similarly colored stripe on its head. The word is often used colloquially to refer to shades of cyan in general."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_dress_and_cropped_jacket_designed_by_Ann_Lowe-_NMAAHC_2014.73.2.1-.2.jpg/330px-Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_dress_and_cropped_jacket_designed_by_Ann_Lowe-_NMAAHC_2014.73.2.1-.2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teal","wikidata":"Q1078214"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Panorama_of_Tabriz.jpg/500px-Panorama_of_Tabriz.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Panorama_of_Tabriz.jpg/1280px-Panorama_of_Tabriz.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_ca